SELECT 'when-to-book-a-wedding-venue', 'published', 4, 'When to Book a Wedding Venue: A Complete Timeline', 'Booking a wedding venue 12-18 months in advance ensures better availability, pricing and premium choices before peak dates fill up.', '/storage/blog/seo/bwPDPU5APxMAQvC1SadgXgMt4Ng0WSnRjPHwOUHo.jpg', '/storage/blogs/00qv3VECdqsazhHpmg37sbslx3bUHPrRW1w1ETDx.jpg', 'Wedding Planning', 'Why Couples Regret Not Booking Their Venue 12 Months Early', 'August 07, 2026', 'Viraaya Weddings Team', '<!--?xml encoding="UTF-8"--><p>Across hundreds of consultations, one regret comes up time and again. Couples walk in already fantasising about a specific property, only to hear that their dates are gone. Six to eight months out, and the venue is already part of someone else’s dream wedding. It happens! You’re so focused on the where that you forget that you’re not the only ones eyeing that gorgeous venue. Sometimes, it truly is a game of fastest-finger-first.</p><p>This is one of the most consistent patterns we see at Viraaya Weddings, and it almost always traces back to the same misunderstanding around <strong>when to book a wedding venue</strong> for a destination wedding. Below, we break down why this happens and how you can plan around it with confidence.</p><h2> </h2><h2 id="why-does-venue-timing-matter-more-for-destination-weddings">Why Does Venue Timing Matter More for Destination Weddings?</h2><p>A destination wedding does not follow the same booking logic as a local city wedding. When you are bringing guests into <a href="/destination-wedding-in-udaipur"><strong>Udaipur</strong></a>, <a href="/destination-wedding/jaisalmer/suryagarh-palace-jaisalmer"><strong>Jaisalmer</strong></a> or <a href="/destination-wedding-in-goa"><strong>Goa</strong></a>, you are by default in charge of coordinating:</p><ul><li>The property itself, which often has limited inventory.</li><li>Room blocks for out-of-town guests.</li><li>Indoor and outdoor venues that typically host one wedding at a time.</li><li>Specific dates that need to work around auspicious timings and guest schedules.</li></ul><p>Premium properties have only a handful of peak-season weekends available each year. Once a couple confirms a date, it’s slipped through your fingers. And there is no waitlist that reopens it later, either.<img alt="Wedding venue booking timeline reference" src="/user/assets/img/blog-inline/63723e221593a528.webp" width="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p><h2> </h2><h2 id="what-happens-when-you-book-a-wedding-venue-late">What Happens When You Book a Wedding Venue Late?</h2><p>Understanding when to book a wedding venue can save both money and unnecessary compromises later.</p><figure class="table"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Booking Early (12-18 months)</strong></td><td><strong>Booking Late (under 6 months)</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Wider date availability</td><td>Limited or no dates remaining</td></tr><tr><td>Better negotiated rates</td><td>Peak-season pricing with little room to negotiate</td></tr><tr><td>Choice of indoor and outdoor venues</td><td>Limited remaining inventory</td></tr><tr><td>Time to plan vendors around the venue</td><td>Vendors working to match a fixed, urgent date</td></tr><tr><td>A more measured planning experience</td><td>Frequent compromise and last-minute decisions</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>After more than a decade of planning destination weddings, we’ve seen couples pay significantly more for the very same property simply because they began their search a few months later. Hotels price according to demand, and demand for premium wedding dates builds long before the season itself begins.</p><h2> </h2><h2 id="when-is-the-right-time-to-book-a-wedding-venue">When Is the Right Time to Book a Wedding Venue?</h2><p>When you’re deciding to book your wedding venue, your destination wedding planning timeline plays a big role. For peak resort destinations, especially between October and March, starting 8-12 months in advance is ideal. For hillside or off-peak locations, timelines can be slightly more flexible, depending on weather and demand patterns.</p><p>A useful way to decide when to book a wedding venue is to follow this timeline:</p><ul><li><strong>12+ months out:</strong> Recommended if you have a specific palace property or heritage venue in mind, as these tend to have very limited room inventory.</li><li><strong>9-11 months out: </strong>This is the sweet spot for booking most premium wedding venues across popular destinations.</li><li><strong>6-8 months out: </strong>You can still find a venue, though your preferred dates and pricing may be harder to secure.</li><li><strong>Under 6 months:</strong> Likely to require compromise on either the venue, preferred dates or both.</li></ul><p>This is not meant to create pressure. It is meant to offer clarity, so you can plan from a position of confidence rather than catching up to a shrinking set of options.<img alt="Wedding venue booking timeline reference" src="/user/assets/img/blog-inline/54ec52ad452700ee.webp" width="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p><h2> </h2><h2 id="how-to-easily-book-your-destination-wedding-venue">How To Easily Book Your Destination Wedding Venue</h2><p>Much of the stress around venue booking comes from the process itself. Couples often spend weeks emailing multiple hotels, waiting for callbacks and comparing quotes that are difficult to compare fairly. By the time clear answers arrive, the date they wanted gets booked by someone else.</p><p>At <a href="/"><strong>Viraaya Weddings</strong></a>, our platform is built to address this specific gap. Rather than approaching each hotel separately, you get:</p><ul><li>Availability verification across destination wedding venues, so you know which dates are open.</li><li>Transparent, detailed pricing with no hidden surprises later in the process.</li><li>Access to hotel rates negotiated through our partnerships, often 10-15% lower than publicly available rates.</li><li>Expert consultation to help you compare properties by budget, guest count and style.</li></ul><p>Knowing how to book a wedding venue shouldn''t feel like guesswork. Go into every conversation knowing exactly what to ask, what to compare and what you''re signing up for. Taking the time to compare these details can prevent expensive surprises later.</p><h2> </h2><h2 id="what-should-you-prepare-before-contacting-wedding-venues">What Should You Prepare Before Contacting Wedding Venues?</h2><p>Before you <strong>book a wedding venue</strong>, it helps to have a few essentials in place. This saves time and signals to planners and hotel teams that you are a serious, organised enquiry.</p><ul><li>Narrow your destinations down to two or three, rather than keeping the list open-ended.</li><li>Have a rough guest count ready, even if it may shift later.</li><li>Define your working budget range.</li><li>Keep some flexibility of a week or two around your preferred dates (if possible).</li></ul><h2> </h2><h2 id="well-help-you-plan-the-perfect-celebration">We’ll Help You Plan the Perfect Celebration</h2><p>Timing is a wedding-planning mistake that’s rarely about taste or style. It is almost always about when the search begins. Couples understandably fall for a venue and assume it will remain available until they are ready. In most cases, it doesn’t.</p><p>If there is one wedding venue tip worth taking from this, it is to start early, even before every detail is finalised. Plans can always be polished later. But a date and a venue that has already been taken by someone else cannot be recovered.</p><p>Backed by over 10 years of experience, 500+ <a href="/hotel-listing"><strong>verified luxury venues</strong></a> across 30+ curated destinations, Viraaya Weddings helps couples shortlist, compare and book with confidence before the best options are gone.</p><p><a href="/wedding-consultation"><strong>Book a consultation with Viraaya Weddings</strong></a> today and let us help you secure the right venue so you don’t have to settle for second-best.</p>', '[{"id": 19, "question": "Should I book my wedding venue before hiring a wedding planner?", "answer": "<p>Booking your wedding venue before hiring a planner isn&#039;t essential. Many couples find it easier to shortlist venues, compare budgets and evaluate logistics with expert guidance first.</p>"}, {"id": 20, "question": "Does booking a venue early actually reduce overall cost?", "answer": "<p>Yes, booking your wedding venue early often gives you access to better rates, more room options and greater flexibility before peak-season demand drives prices up.</p>"}, {"id": 21, "question": "What if I am already within six months of my wedding and have not booked a venue?", "answer": "<p>If your wedding is only six months away, you can still secure a destination wedding venue. Prioritising venues with confirmed availability can help you move quickly and confidently. Working with a platform like Viraaya Weddings helps you quickly identify which properties still have availability that matches your dates, guest count and budget.</p>"}]', 'Why Couples Regret Not Booking Their Venue 12 Months Early', 'Across hundreds of consultations, one regret comes up time and again. Couples walk in already fantasising about a specif...', '/storage/blogs/00qv3VECdqsazhHpmg37sbslx3bUHPrRW1w1ETDx.jpg'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `blog_posts` WHERE `slug` = 'when-to-book-a-wedding-venue');
--> statement-breakpoint
INSERT INTO `blog_posts` (slug, status, position, seo_title, meta_description, og_image, banner_image, category, heading, published_label, author, body_html, faqs, card_title, card_excerpt, card_image)
SELECT 'destination-wedding-venue-checklist', 'published', 5, 'Your Guide to Finding the Perfect Destination Wedding Venue', 'Avoid costly venue mistakes with this destination wedding checklist. Compare budgets, logistics and key details before you book a destination wedding venue.', '/storage/blog/seo/ACt6XIh2xQtuh1IKQcUCyVuHqOUkw5FsAIYgcec6.webp', '/storage/blogs/UuZvdlMGJIxMex8POPN3djFrLVjoXy5hwBAoVwJH.webp', 'Wedding Planning', 'A Simple Checklist Before Booking a Destination Wedding Venue', 'August 05, 2026', 'Viraaya Weddings Team', '<!--?xml encoding="UTF-8"--><p>There’s a particular kind of panic that sets in around month four of wedding planning. It’s not about choosing the wrong venue, but realising it was the right one built on the wrong assumptions. The reel showed golden-hour views and perfect décor, but no one mentioned that the outdoor mandap has no backup during monsoon, or that the layout was never really built for a big fat Indian wedding.</p><p>With over 10 years of experience in the wedding industry, our team at <a href="/"><strong>Viraaya Weddings</strong></a> has seen this come up often, especially when finer venue details aren’t mapped out early. Booking a destination wedding venue is not the same as booking a holiday resort. It needs a different level of scrutiny.</p><p>If you’ve got a destination wedding checklist in hand, you’ll be asking the right questions at the right time, so the excitement is not overshadowed by avoidable surprises later.</p><h2> </h2><h2 id="why-do-you-need-a-destination-wedding-checklist-before-booking-a-venue">Why Do You Need a Destination Wedding Checklist Before Booking a Venue?</h2><p>Here’s the honest answer: because venue decisions are largely irreversible. Once you’ve paid your advance, you''re locked into that property’s calendar, its policies and its limitations.</p><p>A proper <strong>destination wedding planning checklist</strong> does three things for you:</p><ul><li>It forces clarity before emotion takes over.</li><li>It gives you a fair way to compare multiple venues.</li><li>It protects your budget from any last-minute surprises.</li></ul><p>Couples who walk into a venue, having conversations with a checklist in hand, tend to make faster, more confident decisions. Without one, they often end up renegotiating contracts mid-planning, which is rarely a pleasant process for anyone involved.</p><h2> </h2><h2 id="what-should-you-include-in-a-destination-wedding-checklist">What Should You Include in a Destination Wedding Checklist?</h2><p>Let’s break this down into the categories that actually matter, rather than a long, undifferentiated list:</p><h3> </h3><h3 id="1-guest-capacity-and-event-spaces">1. Guest Capacity and Event Spaces</h3><p>The right layout matters just as much as the guest count, especially when multiple events are planned at the same venue.</p><ul><li>What is the seated capacity vs the floating capacity? (Many venues quote higher floating numbers that don’t apply to seated weddings.)</li><li>Are there separate spaces for each ceremony? (Haldi, Sangeet and wedding often need different layouts and flow.)</li><li>Is there an indoor backup for outdoor events? (Important for monsoon season or extreme heat conditions.)</li></ul><h3> </h3><h3 id="2-room-inventory-and-accommodation">2. Room Inventory and Accommodation</h3><p>A venue may host your celebrations comfortably, but still fall short on accommodation for everyone attending.</p><ul><li>How many rooms and suites does the property have?</li><li>Can it accommodate your full guest list, offer a <a href="/hotel-cost-calculator"><strong>resort buyout</strong></a> or will some guests need to be relocated to nearby properties?</li><li>Are there similar-tier hotels nearby for additional guests?</li><li>What is the room-to-guest ratio for a comfortable stay?</li></ul><p>This single point trips up more couples than almost anything else. A venue can look spacious for ceremonies and still fall short on rooms.</p><h3> </h3><h3 id="3-budget-and-pricing-clarity">3. Budget and Pricing Clarity</h3><p>A <strong>wedding venue booking checklist</strong> is incomplete without a clear-eyed look at the budget.</p><ul><li>Does the quoted price include décor and electricity, or are these charged separately?</li><li>What’s the hotel’s cancellation and refund policy?</li><li>Are there hidden costs tied to peak season dates?</li></ul><p>This is also where it helps to look at a detailed <a href="/wedding-packages"><strong>wedding package price list</strong></a> before you finalise anything, so you know exactly what’s bundled into the cost and what isn’t.</p><h3> </h3><h3 id="4-vendor-and-catering-policies">4. Vendor and Catering Policies</h3><p>Vendor policies can significantly influence both your wedding budget and the overall experience, so clarify them early.</p><ul><li>Can I call my own wedding planner and decorator?</li><li>Can we bring in outside caterers, or is catering fully managed by the venue? Are there any exceptions for certain cuisines or ceremonies?</li><li>What is the liquor policy, and can it only be purchased through the venue?</li></ul><h3> </h3><h3 id="5-season-weather-and-date-availability">5. Season, Weather and Date Availability</h3><p>India’s wedding calendar is famously centred around the October to March window. If your dream venue is popular, the good dates disappear fast.</p><ul><li>Is our chosen date a peak-season weekend that could affect availability or pricing?</li><li>What is the weather usually like at the destination during that time of year?</li><li>How far in advance does the venue require a confirmed booking?</li></ul><h3> </h3><h3 id="6-local-regulations-and-permissions">6. Local Regulations and Permissions</h3><p>Local rules can affect your celebrations, so it’s worth confirming permissions before finalising the venue.</p><ul><li>Are there any restrictions on music timings, fireworks or drone photography?</li><li>Does the destination require any local permissions for a baraat or an outdoor procession?</li><li>Who handles these approvals: us, our planner or the venue?</li></ul><h2> </h2><h2 id="how-to-use-a-destination-wedding-checklist">How to Use a Destination Wedding Checklist?</h2><p>You don''t need to interrogate every venue with all six categories on day one. Start broad, then narrow it down.</p><p>A simple way to approach the checklist is:</p><ol><li>Shortlist 3 to 4 venues based on your destination, style and rough budget.</li><li>Run each one through the capacity, budget and vendor questions first.</li><li>Eliminate anything that fails on a non-negotiable.</li><li>Go deeper on logistics and permissions only for your final 1 or 2 options.</li></ol><p>This is, frankly, where most of the stress in venue hunting comes from: trying to evaluate ten venues in full detail at once instead of filtering early.</p><h2> </h2><h2 id="how-viraayaweddings-makes-this-checklist-easier-to-follow">How Viraaya Weddings Makes This Checklist Easier to Follow</h2><p>We built Viraaya Weddings because venue hunting, as it traditionally happens, eats up time that couples and families don''t always have to spare. Instead of calling a dozen properties separately and getting a dozen different formats of information back, you get:</p><ul><li><a href="/check-hotel-availability"><strong>Compare availability</strong></a> across multiple properties for your chosen dates.</li><li>Side-by-side comparisons of venues by budget, capacity and location.</li><li>Transparent, itemised pricing instead of vague estimates.</li><li>Access to negotiated rates through our hotel partnerships.</li><li><a href="/wedding-consultation"><strong>Expert consultation</strong></a> if you''d rather talk through your shortlist with someone who’s done this before.</li></ul><p>In other words, we try to do the boring, repetitive part of the checklist for you, so what’s left for you to decide is the part that’s actually personal: which venue feels right.</p><h2> </h2><h2 id="bring-this-checklist-into-your-next-venue-conversation">Bring This Checklist Into Your Next Venue Conversation</h2><p>A destination wedding checklist isn''t meant to make the process feel transactional. If anything, it does the opposite. When you walk into a venue meeting already clear on capacity, budget and vendor terms, you get to spend the actual conversation talking about the parts that excite you, like how the mandap will look against that courtyard, or where the Sangeet stage will sit.</p><p>If you''re still narrowing down your shortlist, Viraaya Weddings can help you compare 500+ verified <a href="/hotel-listing"><strong>luxury wedding venues</strong></a>, highlight the questions worth asking and ensure nothing important is missed before you sign. We also offer one-to-one recce guidance, so couples and families know exactly what to look for during venue visits.</p><p><a href="/wedding-consultation"><strong>Book a consultation with Viraaya Weddings</strong></a></p>', '[{"id": 16, "question": "What is the most important thing on a destination wedding checklist for venue booking?", "answer": "<p>The most important thing on a destination wedding checklist for venue booking is guest capacity and accommodation inventory. These tend to cause the most last-minute issues, more than décor or even budget. A venue may look perfect in photos, but it still needs to comfortably fit your guest list and support all ceremonies. Always confirm seated capacity, room inventory and indoor backup options first.</p>"}, {"id": 17, "question": "How far in advance should I book a destination wedding venue in India?", "answer": "<p>While planning a destination wedding in India, booking timing matters a lot. For popular destinations like Udaipur, Jaipur and Goa, especially during the October to March peak season, couples typically book 8 to 12 months in advance. Premium heritage and palace venues are often reserved even earlier for peak dates, so starting early gives you better choices and pricing.</p>"}, {"id": 18, "question": "Can Viraaya Weddings help me compare venues even if I haven''t finalised my destination yet?", "answer": "<p>Yes. Even if you haven&#039;t finalised a destination, Viraaya Weddings can help you narrow down your options. We compare destinations and venues side by side based on your budget, guest count and wedding style, using transparent information instead of assumptions.</p>"}]', 'A Simple Checklist Before Booking a Destination Wedding Venue', 'There’s a particular kind of panic that sets in around month four of wedding planning. It’s not about choosing the wrong...', '/storage/blogs/UuZvdlMGJIxMex8POPN3djFrLVjoXy5hwBAoVwJH.webp'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `blog_posts` WHERE `slug` = 'destination-wedding-venue-checklist');
--> statement-breakpoint
INSERT INTO `blog_posts` (slug, status, position, seo_title, meta_description, og_image, banner_image, category, heading, published_label, author, body_html, faqs, card_title, card_excerpt, card_image)
SELECT 'traditional-vs-destination-wedding', 'published', 6, 'Traditional vs Destination Wedding: What''s Best For You?', 'Not sure which wedding style suits you best? Compare traditional vs destination weddings based on budget, planning and guest experience.', '/storage/blog/seo/zqIQWkabXgjnzwxzfPe3NiphQqAWj26RNDGnffHY.webp', '/storage/blogs/qG7Mq3sns0XMW3uy1O5XZhMP4X6DyjCD9sPtBCzg.webp', 'Wedding Planning', 'Traditional Vs Destination Wedding - What’s Best For You?', 'August 07, 2026', 'Viraaya Weddings Team', '<!--?xml encoding="UTF-8"--><p>Every couple eventually lands on this fork in the road: do we get married at the local banquet hall everyone already knows the way to, or do we pack the whole family off to a fort in Rajasthan, a beach in Goa, or a vineyard somewhere far from home? It’s one of the first major wedding planning decisions a couple makes together, and it shapes almost every choice that follows, from your budget to your guest list to how you visualise your whole week.</p><p>At Viraaya Weddings, traditional vs destination wedding comparisons are among the most common discussions we have with couples planning their celebrations. Having helped families explore 500+ <a href="/hotel-listing"><strong>verified luxury venues</strong></a> across 30+ curated destinations, we''ve seen that the right choice depends on their priorities, budget and the overall experience.</p><p> </p><h2 id="what-is-a-destination-wedding-really">What Is a Destination Wedding, Really?</h2><p>Many couples picture beachfront venues and royal palaces when they hear of a “destination wedding”, but the idea goes far beyond the backdrop. Simply put, a destination wedding is a celebration hosted away from the couple’s hometown, usually at a resort, palace or hotel that becomes the venue for every single event, from mehendi to reception. Instead of guests driving home after each function, everyone stays on the same property (or nearby) for at least 2-4 days.</p><p>A traditional wedding, on the other hand, usually takes place over a few days at different local venues. Friends and family drop in for the functions they can make, giving traditional weddings their familiar, community feel. In the end, there''s no right or wrong choice, only what feels right for you.</p><p> </p><h2 id="what-really-sets-traditional-and-destination-weddings-apart">What Really Sets Traditional and Destination Weddings Apart?</h2><p>When families come to us trying to decide between the two, we usually walk them through five practical differences. Here’s how a <strong>traditional vs destination wedding</strong> compares on each one:</p><figure class="table"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Aspect</strong></td><td><strong>Traditional Wedding</strong></td><td><strong>Destination Wedding</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Guest Experience</strong></td><td>Guests show up for a few hours and head home.</td><td>Guests stay for the entire celebration, sharing breakfast, lounging by the pool and showing up to every function together.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Budget Allocation</strong></td><td>Often involves multiple venues, separate catering arrangements and transport across different days.</td><td>Brings all wedding functions under a single roof, making the budget easier to manage, even if the initial cost seems higher.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Planning Timeline</strong></td><td>Can often come together in just a few months if preferred local vendors are available.</td><td>Usually needs 8 to 12 months of lead time, especially at sought-after heritage hotels and resorts, to secure dates and room inventory.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Logistics and Travel</strong></td><td>Generally easier to manage since most guests are local.</td><td>Involves coordinating travel, accommodation and transfers for everyone attending.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>The “Vibe”</strong></td><td>Feels rooted and familiar, rich with local tradition, happening in your own city with your own community around you.</td><td>Feels immersive and cinematic, often because the venue itself, a fort, a palace, a beachfront resort, becomes part of your story.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>Many couples lean toward a destination wedding because it feels like a holiday as much as a celebration, while others tend to stick to tradition simply because it’s easier to pull everyone together close to home.</p><p> </p><h2 id="what-are-the-benefits-of-a-destination-wedding">What Are the Benefits of a Destination Wedding?</h2><p>A destination wedding completely changes the way a celebration feels. With family and friends staying together in one place, the entire experience feels much more connected. Here are the key advantages that couples usually look for today:</p><ul><li><strong>Built-in quality time</strong> with extended family and friends across multiple days, not just one evening.</li><li><strong>A single, stunning backdrop</strong> for every ceremony instead of juggling different halls and décor setups.</li><li><strong>More uninterrupted celebrations, </strong>as guests can be part of every function without travelling between venues or heading home between events.</li><li><strong>A more curated, photogenic experience</strong>, especially at heritage properties and resorts designed specifically for weddings.</li></ul><p><img alt="Traditional and destination wedding comparison reference" src="/user/assets/img/blog-inline/14da986b92399ae9.webp" width="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p><p>That said, destination weddings also mean a smaller guest list in most cases, since not everyone can take time off or afford the travel. If your priority is having your entire extended community present, a traditional wedding might serve you better.</p><p> </p><h2 id="which-wedding-is-better-destination-or-traditional">Which Wedding Is Better: Destination or Traditional?</h2><p>Here''s the truth: when it comes to deciding which wedding is better, destination or traditional, there''s no universal answer. At the end, the choice comes down to what you''re optimising for.</p><p><img alt="Traditional and destination wedding comparison reference" src="/user/assets/img/blog-inline/4babd865b556a7af.webp" width="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p><ul><li>Choose a <strong>traditional wedding </strong>if your priority is a large guest list, lower travel costs and a wedding rooted in your local community and customs.</li><li>Choose a <strong>destination wedding</strong> if your priority is to host an immersive, all-in-one celebration with a smaller, closer guest list and a setting that feels like a getaway, not just an event.</li></ul><p>We''ve worked with couples on both ends of this spectrum, and honestly, we’ve never seen one option leave a family disappointed when it was chosen for the right reasons. The disappointment usually comes from choosing a format because of pressure or trend, not personal fit.</p><p> </p><h2 id="how-much-does-a-destination-wedding-cost-in-india">How Much Does a Destination Wedding Cost in India?</h2><p>Let’s address the elephant in the room directly: destination wedding cost is usually the first concern families raise, and it’s a fair one. Costs vary dramatically depending on the property, the season, the guest count and the number of days.</p><p>To put things into perspective, <a href="/"><strong>luxury destination weddings in India</strong></a><strong> </strong>typically cost between INR 80 lakhs and INR 3 Cr+, depending on the destination, guest count and venue. Venue and accommodation usually make up 35-50% of the budget, followed by food and beverages (20-25%), décor and entertainment (8-10%), photography (4-5%) and a wedding planner, if required (4-5%). While many venues offer bundled packages, it''s worth setting aside a separate budget for décor upgrades, premium experiences and guest travel where these aren''t included.</p><p>Numbers like these can feel overwhelming until you see exactly what they include. That''s why our team at Viraaya Weddings breaks down every cost upfront, with <a href="/check-hotel-availability"><strong>hotel availability</strong></a>, <a href="/hotel-cost-calculator"><strong>transparent pricing</strong></a> and destination comparisons, so you know exactly what you''re paying for before you book.</p><p> </p><h2 id="how-viraayaweddings-makes-this-decision-easier">How Viraaya Weddings Makes This Decision Easier</h2><p>If you''re still weighing up a traditional vs destination wedding in India, planning the next steps shouldn''t feel overwhelming either way.</p><p>With Viraaya Weddings, you''ll compare genuine venue options backed by transparent pricing and tailored recommendations based on your guest count and budget. Thanks to long-standing partnerships with leading hotels in India, you can make decisions based on real numbers rather than rough estimates.</p><p>Whether you''re comparing destinations or shortlisting venues, expert guidance can help you arrive at a decision. Backed by over 10+ years of experience, Viraaya Weddings can help you compare costs and venue options with confidence.</p><p><a href="/wedding-consultation"><strong>Book a Consultation Today</strong></a><strong>!</strong></p>', '[{"id": 13, "question": "Is a destination wedding always more expensive than a traditional wedding?", "answer": "<p>No, a destination wedding is not always more expensive than a traditional wedding. While the venue cost may look higher because it&#039;s often a full-property buyout, traditional weddings spread expenses across multiple venues, vendors and functions, which can add up just as quickly. The overall cost ultimately comes down to your guest list, the number of functions you plan to host and the kind of wedding experience you&#039;re looking to create.</p>"}, {"id": 14, "question": "How far in advance should I start planning a destination wedding in India?", "answer": "<p>You should ideally start planning a destination wedding in India 8 to 12 months in advance, especially if you&#039;re considering a popular heritage venue or getting married during the peak wedding season between October and March. Off-season dates may offer greater flexibility with shorter booking timelines.</p>"}, {"id": 15, "question": "Can I have a smaller traditional-style wedding within a destination setting?", "answer": "<p>Yes, you can host a smaller traditional-style wedding at a destination venue while keeping the ceremonies and traditions that matter most to you. Many couples choose this approach to enjoy a more intimate celebration with close family and friends.</p>"}]', 'Traditional Vs Destination Wedding - What’s Best For You?', 'Every couple eventually lands on this fork in the road: do we get married at the local banquet hall everyone already kno...', '/storage/blogs/qG7Mq3sns0XMW3uy1O5XZhMP4X6DyjCD9sPtBCzg.webp'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `blog_posts` WHERE `slug` = 'traditional-vs-destination-wedding');
--> statement-breakpoint
INSERT INTO `blog_posts` (slug, status, position, seo_title, meta_description, og_image, banner_image, category, heading, published_label, author, body_html, faqs, card_title, card_excerpt, card_image)
SELECT 'arjun-kapoor-sister-anshula-wedding-cost', 'published', 7, 'Anshula Kapoor’s Wedding: A Mumbai Wedding Guide', 'Anshula Kapoor’s wedding was an intimate, one-day, single-venue affair at Taj Lands End. Here’s what a wedding like this typically costs in Mumbai.', '/storage/blog/seo/OlimLn7T4Y7MzdHf87UHLiWEIiTJu5r4gNb0CcUn.webp', '/storage/blogs/ypsiORIHGKEmdPrAEnAgHyBoi2vFHVw2MsVGO5Mu.webp', 'Wedding Planning', 'Anshula Kapoor’s Mumbai Wedding: What a One-Venue Celebration Actually Costs', 'August 07, 2026', 'Viraaya Weddings Team', '<!--?xml encoding="UTF-8"--><p><strong>Arjun Kapoor’s sister, </strong>Anshula Kapoor, married <strong>Rohan Thakkar</strong> on July 6, 2026, and the wedding has been all over social media ever since. At Viraaya Weddings, what stood out to us wasn’t the star power (although we definitely enjoyed it!). It was the format of the wedding: an intimate, one-day ceremony blending two communities’ traditions, hosted entirely at <a href="/destination-wedding/mumbai/taj-lands-end-mumbai"><strong>Taj Lands End in Mumbai</strong></a>, followed by a larger, star-studded reception the next day.</p><p><img alt="Anshula Kapoor wedding planning reference" src="/user/assets/img/blog-inline/df5acdfc4d731061.webp" width="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p><p>That’s a destination wedding format more couples are embracing: one venue, everything under a single roof fewer days, one venue and no city-hopping. Here’s a closer look at what a wedding like Anshula Kapoor’s could cost and what makes the one-venue approach so appealing.</p><p> </p><h2 id="what-does-a-wedding-like-anshula-kapoors-typically-cost">What Does a Wedding Like Anshula Kapoor’s Typically Cost?</h2><p>The family hasn’t publicly disclosed the cost of the wedding. However, based on our experience with similar five-star weddings in Mumbai, a realistic estimate for accommodation and meals can be calculated.</p><p>Room rates at a coastal five-star property such as Taj Lands End, Mumbai, usually range from INR 15,000 to INR 20,000 per night on double occupancy, while per-person meal costs fall between INR 5,000 and INR 6,500 depending on the menu and service style.</p><h2 id="what-determines-the-cost-of-a-one-venue-wedding">What Determines the Cost of a One-Venue Wedding?</h2><p>Couples often assume a single-venue wedding is automatically cheaper because there’s no need to switch between locations. That’s true up to a point, but a few factors still move the number:</p><ul><li><strong>Guest Count</strong>: The biggest lever. Going from 150 to 250 guests can shift catering and accommodation costs by lakhs.</li><li><strong>Number of Functions in One Day</strong>: Anshula Kapoor’s wedding to Rohan Thakkar blended traditions from two communities into a single ceremony, which is efficient, but the décor and catering still need to account for each ritual.</li><li><strong>Venue Category</strong>: A coastal five-star property like Taj Lands End sits at a premium, reflected in the per-night and per-plate rates.</li><li>A coastal five-star property like Taj Lands End sits at a premium versus a standard banquet hall, reflected in the per-night and per-plate rates.</li><li><strong>Reception Scale:</strong> Even at the same property, a larger reception hosted on a separate day (as Anshula and Rohan did at Taj Lands End) adds its own catering, décor and entertainment costs on top of the wedding day itself.</li></ul><p> </p><h2 id="why-couples-are-choosing-the-one-venue-wedding-format">Why Couples Are Choosing the One-Venue Wedding Format</h2><p>Anshula Kapoor’s wedding is a good real-world example of why this format is gaining ground:</p><p><img alt="Anshula Kapoor wedding planning reference" src="/user/assets/img/blog-inline/df8abccc6d280057.webp" width="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p><ul><li><strong>No shuttling guests across the city.</strong> Everyone’s already there for the next function, which cuts down on lost time and transport costs.</li><li><strong>Easier vendor coordination</strong>. One venue means one team manages décor, catering and logistics throughout the day instead of juggling multiple properties.</li><li><strong>Personal touches stand out more</strong>. Anshula''s bridal look featured her late mother’s 42-year-old heirloom dupatta, and it was the detail people remembered most, not the scale of the event. A one-venue format gives these moments room to land.</li><li><strong>A single, unified guest experience. </strong>With everyone in one place, guests move naturally from one function to the next instead of losing time re-arriving, re-dressing or re-orienting at a new venue each day.</li></ul><p> </p><h2 id="how-viraayaweddings-helps-you-plan-a-wedding-like-this">How Viraaya Weddings Helps You Plan a Wedding Like This</h2><p>Most couples asking about the Anshula Kapoor wedding cost aren’t chasing gossip. They’re really asking, “What would this cost me?” That’s where Viraaya Weddings comes in.</p><p>We help you check availability across single-venue properties that can host every function under one roof, get transparent, itemised price breakdowns instead of vague brochure ranges and compare venues side by side through an expert consultation tailored to your guest count and budget.</p><p>Our negotiated hotel partnerships also mean you’re rarely paying the rate listed online, which matters when a single-venue wedding budget is already stretching into crores.</p><p><a href="/wedding-consultation"><strong>Book a consultation with Viraaya Weddings</strong></a>, and let’s plan yours together.</p>', '[{"id": 10, "question": "Is the one-venue format suitable for larger guest lists?", "answer": "<p>Yes, most luxury five-star properties can comfortably host 150 to 250+ guests across multiple functions, given that the venue has different indoor and outdoor venues (lawns, ballrooms, poolside areas) to keep each function feeling fresh rather than repetitive.</p>"}, {"id": 11, "question": "Is a one-venue wedding cheaper than a multi-location wedding?", "answer": "<p>Yes, a one-venue wedding is generally cheaper than a multi-location wedding. Hosting every function at one property, as Anshula Kapoor’s wedding did, reduces guest transfers, vendor duplication and logistics costs, though the total still depends heavily on guest count and venue category.</p>"}, {"id": 12, "question": "How can Viraaya Weddings help me plan a single-venue wedding?", "answer": "<p>Viraaya Weddings gives you up-to-date availability and transparent pricing across venues that can host every function in one place, plus expert consultation to compare options by guest capacity and budget, so you’re not left estimating the way the internet did with this wedding&#039;s cost.</p>"}]', 'Anshula Kapoor’s Mumbai Wedding: What a One-Venue Celebration Actually Costs', 'Arjun Kapoor’s sister,&nbsp;Anshula Kapoor, married&nbsp;Rohan Thakkar on July 6, 2026, and the wedding has been all ove...', '/storage/blogs/ypsiORIHGKEmdPrAEnAgHyBoi2vFHVw2MsVGO5Mu.webp'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `blog_posts` WHERE `slug` = 'arjun-kapoor-sister-anshula-wedding-cost');
--> statement-breakpoint
INSERT INTO `blog_posts` (slug, status, position, seo_title, meta_description, og_image, banner_image, category, heading, published_label, author, body_html, faqs, card_title, card_excerpt, card_image)
SELECT 'plan-luxury-destination-wedding-like-nupur-sanon-stebin-ben', 'published', 8, 'Plan a Luxury Destination Wedding Like Nupur Sanon & Stebin', 'Recreate the Nupur Sanon and Stebin Ben celebrity luxury destination wedding look with these venue, décor and budget ideas for your own Udaipur celebration.', '/storage/blog/seo/HaJ5c8E1ZCE0f8xQtkOwbfBMa8S5CstQORJ4VK7I.webp', '/storage/blogs/VdoZAQUiqWSs8fC8NHmKAvARIovOGgeWsqeW43ve.webp', 'Wedding Planning', 'Nupur Sanon & Stebin Ben: Plan a Luxury Destination Wedding Like Them', 'August 07, 2026', 'Viraaya Weddings Team', '<!--?xml encoding="UTF-8"--><p>There''s something about a Bollywood wedding that makes the rest of us reach for our Pinterest boards. When Nupur Sanon and Stebin Ben got married at <a href="/destination-wedding/udaipur/raffles-udaipur"><strong>Raffles Udaipur</strong></a> earlier this January, the 3-day celebration instantly became one of those moments everyone was talking about and taking cues from, for destination weddings. Soft lighting, lake views, an off-shoulder gown that looked like it floated rather than walked. It was the kind of <strong>celebrity luxury destination wedding</strong> that makes you rethink your own moodboard entirely.</p><p>At Viraaya Weddings, couples often ask us how they can create a wedding that feels “like that Udaipur celebration” without really knowing where to begin. So we’ve broken it down for you properly, from the venue and styling to the décor choices, along with a realistic sense of what it might cost to bring a similar vision to life.</p><p> </p><h2 id="the-venue-why-udaipur-continues-to-win-for-destination-weddings">The Venue: Why Udaipur Continues to Win for Destination Weddings</h2><p>Nupur and Stebin chose Raffles Udaipur, a lake-facing property right in the middle of Udai Sagar Lake, reached only by boat. Even that small detail set the mood early on, guests gliding in across the water in an unhurried, almost cinematic way before the celebrations had even begun.</p><p>Their reception, on the other hand, happened far from the lake, in the ninth-floor ballroom of <a href="/destination-wedding/mumbai/the-st-regis-mumbai"><strong>The St. Regis Mumbai.</strong></a> It''s a useful reminder that a destination wedding doesn''t have to be a single location end-to-end. Many couples now split ceremonies and receptions across cities to suit family logistics and guest convenience, while still positioning the “wedding” itself somewhere memorable.</p><p>Udaipur keeps showing up in celebrity-style wedding stories time and again, and it''s not just about brand value. The city offers heritage architecture, lakefront settings and five-star infrastructure within a fairly compact radius, which makes planning logistics genuinely easier than couples expect.</p><p>If you''re exploring <a href="/destination-wedding-in-udaipur"><strong>destination wedding venues in Udaipur</strong></a>, you’ll find that the range spans from intimate boutique properties to full-scale palace hotels, so the “Udaipur look” is achievable well outside celebrity budgets, too.<img alt="Luxury destination wedding planning reference" src="/user/assets/img/blog-inline/00314c05d2da0f4f.webp" width="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p><p> </p><h2 id="the-look-soft-glam-not-spectacle">The Look: Soft Glam, Not Spectacle</h2><p>What made this celebrity luxury destination wedding stand out wasn''t an excess. Rather, it was restraint, done well.</p><p>For her Christian ceremony, Nupur wore a sculpted off-shoulder gown with delicate lace detailing and a long veil, which styling editors are calling “soft-glam bridal.” For the Hindu ceremony, both Nupur and Stebin wore custom Manish Malhotra ensembles, and Nupur''s pre-wedding look included a red lehenga for the rituals.</p><p>A few styling choices that translate well even on a non-celebrity budget:</p><ul><li><strong>Off-shoulder silhouettes</strong> with minimal embellishment for a contemporary white wedding look.</li><li><strong>One strong colour shift</strong> between ceremonies (white for vows, red for rituals) rather than five different palettes.</li><li><strong>A statement veil or drape</strong> as the single dramatic element, letting the rest of the outfit stay poised and clean.</li></ul><p>This is the easiest part of a celebrity-style wedding to recreate. You don''t even need the designer''s name attached to your outfit. You just need the right proportion to create the same look that seemed expensive in photographs.</p><p> </p><h2 id="the-decor-where-the-budget-really-shows">The Décor: Where the Budget Really Shows</h2><p>The Mumbai reception, themed Maison Rouge Infinity, is where the décor ambition thrived. Featuring a blacked-out ballroom, a black-and-white palette with broad red accents, sculptural red trees and a custom Van Gogh-inspired carpet, the venue also incorporated details drawn from the bride''s handwritten notes.</p><p>That''s a fully custom, design-led production, the kind that typically involves a dedicated décor studio working months in advance. But the underlying ideas scale down beautifully:</p><ul><li>A monochrome base palette with one bold accent colour instead of a dozen competing tones.</li><li>A single striking “moment” (a media wall, an art floor, a sculptural installation) rather than spreading the décor budget thin across every corner.</li><li>Custom, personal touches like monograms or handwriting, which often cost less than expected, make the celebration feel more personal.</li></ul><p> </p><h2 id="what-would-it-cost-to-recreate-nupur-stebins-wedding-in-udaipur">What Would It Cost to Recreate Nupur &amp; Stebin''s Wedding in Udaipur?</h2><p>We get asked this constantly, so here''s a rough, realistic range based on what we see across similar venue categories and décor scopes for Udaipur weddings. These are indicative figures meant to help you plan, not a quote.</p><figure class="table"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Element</strong></td><td><strong>Budget-Conscious</strong></td><td><strong>Mid-Range</strong></td><td><strong>Premium (Celebrity-Style)</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Lakefront/Heritage Venue<br>(2N/3D~150-200 guests)</td><td>INR 35 - 50 lakhs</td><td>INR 70 lakhs - 1.2 Cr</td><td>INR 1.5 Cr+</td></tr><tr><td>Bridal &amp; Groom Couture<br>(2-3 outfits)</td><td>INR 1.5 - 3 lakhs</td><td>INR 5 - 10 lakhs</td><td>INR 15 lakhs+</td></tr><tr><td>Themed Décor<br>(per major ceremony)</td><td>INR 3 - 6 lakhs</td><td>INR 10 - 18 lakhs</td><td>INR 25 lakhs+</td></tr><tr><td>Photography &amp; Films</td><td>INR 2 - 4 lakhs</td><td>INR 6 - 10 lakhs</td><td>INR 15 lakhs+</td></tr><tr><td>Sound, Light &amp; Stage Production</td><td>INR 1.5 - 3 lakhs</td><td>INR 5 - 10 lakhs</td><td>INR 15 - 25 lakhs</td></tr><tr><td>Entertainment (DJ/live band/artists, across functions)</td><td>INR 1.5 - 3 lakhs</td><td>INR 8 - 15 lakhs</td><td>INR 25 lakhs+</td></tr><tr><td>Hair &amp; Makeup (bride + family, multi-day)</td><td>INR 1 - 2 lakhs</td><td>INR 3 - 6 lakhs</td><td>INR 10 - 15 lakhs</td></tr><tr><td>Catering &amp; Bar (150-200 pax, multi-day)</td><td>INR 10 - 15 lakhs</td><td>INR 25 - 40 lakhs</td><td>INR 60 lakhs+</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>Numbers shift based on guest count, season and exactly which property you choose, which is why we always recommend running your own shortlist through a proper estimate before locking anything in.</p><p><img alt="Luxury destination wedding planning reference" src="/user/assets/img/blog-inline/63723e221593a528.webp" width="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p><p>Our <a href="/hotel-cost-calculator"><strong>Hotel Cost Calculator</strong></a> helps take the guesswork out of wedding budgeting. Share your guest count, shortlisted hotels and dates, and you''ll get a personalised budget overview instead of guessing from someone else''s venue budget.</p><p> </p><h2 id="bringing-your-forever-to-life">Bringing Your Forever to Life</h2><p>The honest truth about most celebrity luxury destination wedding inspiration is that the wedding itself is rarely about copying decor pixel-for-pixel. It''s about the feeling: easygoing, personal, and beautifully photographed because everyone in the room actually felt at ease.</p><p>That feeling usually comes from clarity right at the start of planning. When your venue is locked in for your dates, when you have a realistic sense of what your décor vision will cost before you get too attached to it and when your vendors are chosen for how well they fit your destination rather than just convenience, everything starts to feel a lot more in control.</p><p>At Viraaya Weddings, that''s the gap we exist to close for high-budget weddings in India and for modest ones alike. Whether you''re drawn to Udaipur''s lakes or want to explore other <a href="/"><strong>destination wedding venues in India</strong></a>, we’ll coordinate with the venue team to lock in your preferred dates, get transparent cost comparisons and speak with someone who''s planned weddings at these exact properties before.</p><p>If a Raffles-style lakefront wedding or a Mumbai ballroom reception is somewhere on your inspiration board, <a href="/wedding-consultation"><strong>book a consultation</strong></a> with our team and let''s figure out what your version of it actually looks like.</p>', '[{"id": 7, "question": "Where did Nupur Sanon and Stebin Ben get married?", "answer": "<p>In January 2026, Nupur Sanon and Stebin Ben got married at Raffles Udaipur, right by Udai Sagar Lake. What followed wasn’t a single-day celebration but a few unhurried days of ceremonies, first a Christian wedding, then Hindu rituals, before the celebrations moved to The St. Regis Mumbai for a reception that brought together friends from the film and music world.</p>"}, {"id": 8, "question": "How much does a celebrity-style destination wedding in Udaipur typically cost?", "answer": "<p>A celebrity-style destination wedding in Udaipur for around 150-200 guests over 2 nights and 3 days can range from about INR 60 lakhs for a simpler setup to over INR 1.5 crore for a fully customised, high-production celebration, depending on venue, décor and scale.</p>"}, {"id": 9, "question": "How far in advance should we lock in a venue like Raffles Udaipur for our wedding dates?", "answer": "<p>For a lakefront heritage property like Raffles Udaipur, aim to lock in your venue 8 to 12 months before your wedding date, especially for peak season (October to February). Popular weekends fill up fast, so reach out early with your dates. Off-season bookings offer more flexibility and better pricing.</p>"}]', 'Nupur Sanon & Stebin Ben: Plan a Luxury Destination Wedding Like Them', 'There''s something about a Bollywood wedding that makes the rest of us reach for our Pinterest boards. When Nupur Sanon a...', '/storage/blogs/VdoZAQUiqWSs8fC8NHmKAvARIovOGgeWsqeW43ve.webp'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `blog_posts` WHERE `slug` = 'plan-luxury-destination-wedding-like-nupur-sanon-stebin-ben');
--> statement-breakpoint
INSERT INTO `blog_posts` (slug, status, position, seo_title, meta_description, og_image, banner_image, category, heading, published_label, author, body_html, faqs, card_title, card_excerpt, card_image)
SELECT 'vijay-rashmika-udaipur-wedding-cost', 'published', 9, 'Vijay & Rashmika Wedding Cost: An Udaipur Budget Guide', 'Curious about the Vijay & Rashmika wedding cost? Here''s what it tells you about real Udaipur wedding budgets and how to plan one without overspending.', '/storage/blog/seo/Ekn6oFenjN1a3oPjL2QucIHHJzSKYRNnw78P60rr.webp', '/storage/blogs/YqIpqXeVijLv5u47bV79D4bgMeyJ5Bna2rgpC3Wa.webp', 'Wedding Planning', 'Vijay & Rashmika Udaipur Wedding Cost & Venue Guide', 'August 07, 2026', 'Viraaya Weddings Team', '<!--?xml encoding="UTF-8"--><p>Every couple of months, a celebrity wedding takes over our feeds, and this year, it was Vijay Deverakonda and Rashmika Mandanna, who tied the knot at Mementos by ITC Hotels, Ekaaya Udaipur. Within hours of the news breaking, one question was everywhere: how much did the wedding actually cost?</p><p>Reports on the <strong>Vijay &amp; Rashmika wedding cost</strong> have varied wildly, with some pegging it at around INR 12 Cr and others estimating it closer to INR 20 to 30 Cr, once we factor in multiple ceremonies, the reported gold and the grand reception in Hyderabad. The wedding itself took place at a luxury hilltop resort in the Aravalli Hills, where industry estimates suggest that a destination wedding usually ranges from INR 90 lakhs to INR 2.5 Cr, depending on scale and guest count.</p><p><img src="/user/assets/img/blog-inline/17ec7a130ad1465b.jpg" alt="Wedding luxury reception" width="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p><p>At Viraaya Weddings, we get a version of this question almost every week, just without the celebrity gossip attached. “What does a wedding like that actually cost?” is really code for “how do I budget for mine?” So we thought it would be worth pulling apart the reported cost of Vijay &amp; Rashmika''s wedding, separating fact from speculation and using it as a real example of how Udaipur weddings are priced.</p><p> </p><h2 id="so-what-does-a-normal-udaipur-wedding-cost">So, What Does a “Normal” Udaipur Wedding Cost?</h2><p>Here''s the part that should put your mind at ease: the wedding cost of Vijay and Rashmika is from a different universe entirely, one with private OTT deals, multiple cities and hundreds of crew members. Your Udaipur wedding cost doesn''t have to look anything like that.</p><p>Based on what we see across the city''s hotels and palaces, here''s a reliable cost breakdown for destination weddings in Udaipur in 2026:</p><figure class="table"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Wedding Scale</strong></td><td><strong>Guest Count</strong></td><td><strong>Typical Wedding Cost</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Intimate</td><td>50-100 guests</td><td>INR 60 lakhs to 1 Cr</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-range</td><td>100-250 guests</td><td>INR 1 Cr to INR 2.5 Cr</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>The<strong> cost of a Udaipur destination wedding </strong>can vary widely, but most couples don''t need a celebrity-sized budget to create a memorable experience.</p><p> </p><h2 id="what-determines-the-cost-of-a-destination-wedding-in-udaipur">What Determines the Cost of a Destination Wedding in Udaipur?</h2><p>Many couples assume the venue is where most of the money goes. While it is often the largest expense, guest count, décor and entertainment, guest logistics and experiences can quickly add up as well.</p><p><strong>Venue (per person, per day): INR 15,000 to INR 60,000:</strong></p><p>This is your base package, covering accommodation, meals and party areas. Meals are never billed separately from the venue. Heritage palaces sit at the higher end of this range, while modern luxury resorts tend to fall lower to mid-range.</p><p>Everything else sits outside this base pricing and package, and it is where most of the cost variation occurs:</p><ul><li><strong>Décor</strong>: INR 30 lakhs to INR 70 lakhs+, depending on scale and design complexity.</li><li><strong>Stage production:</strong> INR 7 lakhs to INR 10 lakhs</li><li><strong>Entertainment</strong>: INR 10 lakhs to INR 20 lakhs</li><li><strong>Photographer</strong>: INR 5 lakhs to 8 INR lakhs</li><li><strong>All-day lounge:</strong> INR 2 lakhs to INR 4 lakhs</li><li><strong>Room hampers:</strong> INR 1 lakh to INR 3 lakhs</li></ul><p>Also, this is often the point at which <strong>palace wedding costs in Udaipur </strong>start to vary significantly. A heritage property and a modern luxury resort can have wildly different per-plate and per-room rates, and that difference alone can shift your total budget by tens of lakhs.</p><p> </p><h2 id="why-couples-keep-choosing-udaipur-anyway">Why Couples Keep Choosing Udaipur Anyway</h2><p>Even with rising budgets, Udaipur remains a favourite choice for destination weddings.</p><p>The city offers something genuinely rare: lakes, palaces and centuries of history that photograph beautifully without you needing to do much at all. <a href="/destination-wedding-in-udaipur"><strong>Wedding venues in Udaipur</strong></a> range from intimate heritage havelis to sprawling five-star palaces on private islands, which means there''s a fit for almost every budget and guest list, not just the ones making headlines.</p><p><img alt="Udaipur wedding cost planning reference" src="/user/assets/img/blog-inline/1c01fb9a92dff033.webp" width="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p><p>The<strong> </strong>Vijay &amp; Rashmika wedding cost prompted many couples to take a closer look at the cost of an Udaipur destination wedding. While most people won''t have a celebrity-sized budget, Udaipur offers fairytale-like wedding settings across a range of price points. The key is choosing an experience that fits your vision and budget.</p><p> </p><h2 id="how-viraayaweddings-helps-you-get-there-without-the-guesswork">How Viraaya Weddings Helps You Get There Without the Guesswork</h2><p>Here is when Viraaya Weddings comes into the picture. While headlines focus on the Vijay &amp; Rashmika wedding cost, most couples are trying to figure out something far more practical: which property fits their guest count, what it will actually cost once everything is added up and whether they''re getting a fair deal.</p><p>We help you check current availability across Udaipur''s top properties, transparent price breakdowns with nothing hidden under the covers and an expert consultation to help you compare Udaipur wedding packages side by side. Instead of cold-calling a dozen hotels and getting different answers each time, you get one clear picture.</p><p><img src="/user/assets/img/blog-inline/07108cd4658fd907.jpg" alt="Udaipur wedding palace" width="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p><p>With Viraaya Weddings, you don''t have to pay the rate you see online. Our exclusive hotel partnerships often unlock better deals, which can go a long way when wedding budgets are already stretching into lakhs, and even crores, at times.</p><p> </p><h2 id="getting-your-udaipur-wedding-budget-right">Getting Your Udaipur Wedding Budget Right</h2><p>The conversation around the<strong> </strong>Vijay &amp; Rashmika wedding cost<strong> </strong>highlights an important reality: there is no one-size-fits-all budget for a Udaipur wedding. The right budget depends on the celebration you want.</p><p>Start by finalising your guest list and preferred wedding season, as both have a major impact on the overall budget. Next, think about the kind of setting you want. A heritage palace and a modern luxury resort can offer very different experiences, and that one decision alone can change your estimated palace wedding cost in Udaipur by several lakhs.</p><p>If you''re still figuring out where your priorities lie, Viraaya Weddings'' expert consultations can help. It''s often the stage where couples have plenty of inspiration saved but little clarity on what it might actually cost to turn those ideas into a wedding plan. Connect with our experts to get a clearer picture of what your dream wedding could look like and what it may cost.</p><p><a href="/wedding-consultation"><strong>Book a consultation with Viraaya Weddings</strong></a></p>', '[{"id": 1, "question": "How much did the Vijay & Rashmika wedding actually cost?", "answer": "<p>Reports on the Vijay &amp; Rashmika wedding cost vary, with estimates ranging from around INR 12 Cr to over INR 20 Cr, including multiple ceremonies, reported gold expenses and a separate reception in Hyderabad. The Udaipur venue itself, Mementos by ITC Hotels, Ekaaya Udaipur, is estimated to host weddings between INR 90 lakh and INR 2.5 Cr, depending on scale.</p>"}, {"id": 2, "question": "Is Udaipur an expensive city for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p>No, Udaipur is not an expensive city to host a destination wedding. While headline-making celebrations like the Vijay &amp; Rashmika wedding cost suggest sky-high numbers, a destination wedding in Udaipur usually falls within the range of INR 60 lakhs to INR 1 Cr, typically covers the complete wedding, including venue, décor, catering and accommodation, making Udaipur accessible across a wide range of budgets.</p>"}, {"id": 3, "question": "How can Viraaya Weddings help reduce my Udaipur wedding cost?", "answer": "<p>Viraaya Weddings gives you transparent, real-time pricing across Udaipur properties along with negotiated hotel rates, so you avoid overpaying due to a lack of comparison. Our expert consultations also help you choose Udaipur wedding packages that match your guest list and budget without compromising on the experience.</p>"}]', 'Vijay & Rashmika Udaipur Wedding Cost & Venue Guide', 'Every couple of months, a celebrity wedding takes over our feeds, and this year, it was Vijay Deverakonda and Rashmika M...', '/storage/blogs/YqIpqXeVijLv5u47bV79D4bgMeyJ5Bna2rgpC3Wa.webp'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `blog_posts` WHERE `slug` = 'vijay-rashmika-udaipur-wedding-cost');
--> statement-breakpoint
INSERT INTO `blog_posts` (slug, status, position, seo_title, meta_description, og_image, banner_image, category, heading, published_label, author, body_html, faqs, card_title, card_excerpt, card_image)
SELECT 'nupur-sanon-stebin-ben-wedding-cost', 'published', 10, 'How Much Would Nupur Sanon & Stebin Ben''s Wedding Cost?', 'Curious about the cost of a wedding like Nupur Sanon and Stebin Ben? Explore venue, decor, fashion, catering, and budget estimates in India.', '/storage/blog/seo/GI5FPkZHNmK9zNSRDwJqD3kpXOD4pBZh8dyLMzZj.webp', '/storage/blogs/zL5Jpos9PGdmjoDqzhjLhcHJoABnGb6iprvKvLZV.webp', 'Wedding Planning', 'How Much Would a Wedding Like Nupur Sanon & Stebin Ben Cost in India?', 'August 07, 2026', 'Viraaya Weddings Team', '<!--?xml encoding="UTF-8"--><p>Who doesn’t love a good Bollywood wedding? In January of 2026, Nupur Sanon, sister of actor Kriti Sanon, shared the happy news of her engagement to longtime partner, singer Stebin Ben, declaring it to be “the easiest YES” she’s ever had to say. </p><p>Their wedding took place in the glorious City of Lakes and Love. </p><p>That’s Udaipur, of course. </p><p>As we scroll through the star-studded guest list and like every single Instagram post, what stands out is the soft glam and romance. Every photograph is lit by candlelight and we can’t help but match the smiles of the happy couple. </p><p>If their multi-ceremony love story has you dreaming a little, come along as we unravel the details (including what a<strong> </strong>celebrity wedding like this can cost in India) and help you imagine one of your own.</p><p> </p><h2 id="where-did-nupur-sanon-and-stebin-ben-get-married">Where Did Nupur Sanon and Stebin Ben Get Married?</h2><p>For their wedding celebrations, Nupur Sanon and Stebin Ben chose <a href="/destination-wedding/udaipur/raffles-udaipur"><strong>Raffles Udaipur</strong></a>, a venue that has hosted its fair share of grand celebrity weddings over the years. The festivities began with a haldi and chooda ceremony awash in saffron, turmeric and ochre tones, followed by the classic mehndi and sangeet celebrations. </p><figure class="image"><img alt="Nupur Sanon and Stebin Ben wedding planning reference" src="/user/assets/img/blog-inline/5b64a10897f8f1a0.webp" width="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></figure><p>Then came the part we cannot stop thinking about. The couple chose to honour both their faiths through two wedding ceremonies, one Hindu and one Christian, both handled with care and honour.</p><p>A reception later took place at The St. Regis Mumbai, where the couple celebrated with friends from the film and music industries. </p><p> </p><h2 id="how-much-does-a-celebrity-wedding-cost-in-india">How Much Does a Celebrity Wedding Cost in India?</h2><p>Naturally, no <i>official</i> details have been shared about Nupur Sanon and Stebin Ben’s<strong> </strong>celebrity wedding cost. However, we <i>can</i> make an educated guess. </p><p>For a destination wedding with around 200 guests, venue costs alone at premium properties in Udaipur can range from ₹60 lakh and ₹3 crore (costs go even higher during peak season, between October and February). The Stebin Ben and Nupur Sanon wedding sits comfortably in the upper bracket. A good amount of this is driven by the legacy of Raffles Udaipur''s pricing model and the peak season.</p><p>However, you do not always need a celebrity wedding budget to have something comparable in the beautiful city of Udaipur. The city gives you a lot to work with.</p><p> </p><h2 id="why-do-families-choose-udaipur-for-weddings">Why Do Families Choose Udaipur for Weddings?</h2><p>There is a reason Udaipur shows up in every serious conversation about <strong>destination wedding costs in India</strong>. The lakes, the Aravalli hills, the heritage palaces, the sheer visual drama of the place: it photographs beautifully and feels special to every guest who travels in for the weekend. There’s little doubt why Udaipur is frequently touted as the most romantic city in India. </p><p><img alt="Nupur Sanon and Stebin Ben wedding planning reference" src="/user/assets/img/blog-inline/1879ddb9727fdbca.webp" width="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p><p>For couples in Indian metro cities, it is also very practical. Udaipur has direct flights from Mumbai, Delhi, and Ahmedabad. Chartered flights from Bengaluru and Hyderabad are common for larger guest lists. Years of luxury weddings have also shaped a seasoned ecosystem of vendors in Udaipur, including decorators, caterers and hospitality teams who know exactly how to bring even the most ambitious celebrations to life. </p><p>Just like Nupur Sanon and Stebin Ben’s wedding, Udaipur''s premier properties are designed to host complex, multi-ceremony celebrations across different spaces within the same hotel.</p><p> </p><h2 id="the-top-wedding-venues-in-udaipur-and-what-they-cost">The Top Wedding Venues in Udaipur and What They Cost</h2><p>If your wedding vision looks anything like what Nupur and Stebin pulled off, here is a straightforward guide to <strong>luxury wedding costs in India</strong>. The following prices are based on a 2-night and 3-day celebration and assume a full buyout of the venue.</p><p> </p><h3 id="1-raffles-udaipur">1) Raffles Udaipur</h3><p>The venue from the Sanon-Ben wedding. A private island on Udai Sagar Lake, accessible by boat. 137 rooms, multiple lawns and indoor venues, and that signature European-Rajasthani architecture. </p><p><strong>Estimated cost:</strong> ₹2.5 crore to ₹3 crore. </p><p> </p><h3 id="2-taj-aravali-resort-and-spa">2) Taj Aravali Resort and Spa</h3><p>A stunning venue from the Taj legacy, this resort is modern and large-scale, pairing surprisingly well with Udaipur''s heritage aesthetic. With 181 elegantly designed rooms, suites, and tents, Taj Aravali Resort &amp; Spa offers a breathtaking setting for a hillside wedding in Udaipur.</p><p><strong>Estimated cost: </strong>₹1.8 crore to ₹2.5 crore.</p><p> </p><h3 id="3-taj-lake-palace">3) Taj Lake Palace</h3><p>A floating 18th-century white marble palace in the middle of Lake Pichola. Guests arrive by shikara, and the palace can host up to 200 guests outdoors. Intimate and unmistakably iconic. </p><p><strong>Estimated cost: </strong>₹3 crore to ₹3.5 crore.</p><p> </p><h3 id="4-the-oberoi-udaivilas">4) The Oberoi Udaivilas</h3><p>Consistently among the best-reviewed luxury hotels in the world. Full lake views, private plunge pools and the elegance of a royal Mewari palace: the property is renowned for its privacy and breathtaking setting. Its 87 rooms and suites make it perfect for intimate wedding celebrations (larger events often accommodate guests across nearby luxury properties). </p><p><strong>Estimated cost: </strong>₹3.5 crore to ₹4.5 crore.</p><p> </p><h3 id="5-the-leela-palace-udaipur">5) The Leela Palace Udaipur</h3><p>Five distinct venue spaces on the edge of the glittering Lake Pichola, including the dramatic outdoor Rangmanch courtyard. Often brought up in publications as India''s leading wedding venue. </p><p><strong>Estimated cost: </strong>₹2.5 crore to ₹3 crore.</p><p> </p><h3 id="6-fairmont-udaipur-palace">6) Fairmont Udaipur Palace</h3><p>Built specifically for grand Indian weddings. Mughal-inspired architecture, striking accents, large ballrooms and lush gardens that handle big guest lists beautifully. </p><p><strong>Estimated cost: </strong>₹5 crore to ₹6.5 crore.</p><p> </p><h3 id="7-jagmandir-island-palace">7) Jagmandir Island Palace</h3><p>Managed by the Mewar royal family and sitting on its own island on Lake Pichola, this property is unlike any other. Often used for standalone functions like sangeet or cocktail evenings rather than full buyouts. </p><p><strong>Estimated cost:</strong> ₹1.5 crore and ₹3.5 crore.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Wedding planning pro tip:</strong> destination wedding costs in India hinge on a colourful spectrum of requirements. Guest count, room categories, number of functions, décor direction and food and beverage requirements all play a part. In cities like Udaipur especially, pricing can shift dramatically with the season and overall demand, so it’s always wise to treat estimates as flexible until the hotel confirms the final quote. </p><p> </p><h2 id="plan-your-wedding-in-udaipur-with-viraayaweddings">Plan Your Wedding in Udaipur with Viraaya Weddings</h2><p>If celebrity wedding costs in India have you dreaming a little, now is the time to begin building your moodboard. Availability across luxury venues shifts quickly between October and March, and direct conversations with hotels can often turn into weeks of back-and-forth before pricing becomes clear. </p><p>Viraaya Weddings is an intelligent destination wedding platform designed for Indian couples looking for spectacular venues. With  <a href="/check-hotel-availability"><strong>availability checks</strong></a>, <a href="/hotel-cost-calculator"><strong>transparent pricing</strong></a> and side-by-side venue comparisons across budgets, guest counts and destinations, the platform brings clarity to a process that often feels overwhelming and shrouded in mystery. Backed by over a decade of experience across hundreds of Indian weddings, the team understands both the scale and the emotion behind these celebrations.</p><p>If Nupur and Stebin’s Udaipur wedding feels close to your vision, this is a good place to begin. Trust your gut!</p><p>Need help narrowing things down? <a href="/wedding-consultation"><strong>Speak with a senior wedding expert</strong></a> if you need help narrowing things down.</p>', '[{"id": 4, "question": "What celebrities have gotten married at Raffles, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Raffles Udaipur has already hosted several high-profile celebrity weddings, including those of Hardik Pandya and Natasa Stankovic, as well as P. V. Sindhu and Venkata Datta Sai.</p>"}, {"id": 5, "question": "What is the most affordable month to get married in Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>The most affordable time to get married in Udaipur is usually during the off-season, between May and August. Venues and hotels often offer lower rates during these months due to the summer heat and monsoon season.</p>"}, {"id": 6, "question": "What is the most expensive wedding in Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>One of the most expensive weddings ever hosted in Udaipur was the November 2025 wedding of Netra Mantena and Vamsi Gadiraju. The multi-day celebrations took place across some of the city&#039;s most iconic heritage venues, including Jagmandir Island Palace, Taj Lake Palace and The Leela Palace. Guests enjoyed appearances from celebrities such as Jennifer Lopez, Ranveer Singh, Shahid Kapoor, Dia Mirza, Janhvi Kapoor, Jacqueline Fernandez and Nora Fatehi. While exact figures are unconfirmed, we estimate that the celebrations cost upwards of ₹75 to 90 crore, making it one of Udaipur&#039;s most lavish weddings to date.</p>"}]', 'How Much Would a Wedding Like Nupur Sanon & Stebin Ben Cost in India?', 'Who doesn’t love a good Bollywood wedding? In January of 2026, Nupur Sanon, sister of actor Kriti Sanon, shared the happ...', '/storage/blogs/zL5Jpos9PGdmjoDqzhjLhcHJoABnGb6iprvKvLZV.webp'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `blog_posts` WHERE `slug` = 'nupur-sanon-stebin-ben-wedding-cost');
